<h2>The Original &amp; the best Pub Crawl in Krakow since 2008</h2>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_text disabled_on="off||" admin_label="intro" _builder_version="4.24.3" text_font="Montserrat||||||||" background_size="initial" background_position="top_left" background_repeat="repeat" text_orientation="justified" hover_enabled="0" use_border_color="off" border_style="solid" global_colors_info="{}" sticky_enabled="0"]<p>We, the Krawl Through Krakow have run for almost a decade. In that time we have concocted a recipe for the most outrageous night out you will ever live through. Scenes from the Hangover set in the backdrop of Medieval Europe are what you should picture. <a href="https://krawlthroughkrakow.com/krakow-nightclubs/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Best underground bars and clubs</a>, toasting with local nutters and punishing your friends in drinking games. It's any fun person's wet dream of a night out! What are you waiting for? <a href="https://krawlthroughkrakow.com/how-to-join/">Join us tonight</a> for the best Pub Crawl experience you'll probably forget.</p>[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure="1_2,1_2" padding_mobile="off" column_padding_mobile="on" admin_label="Row" _builder_version="4.16" background_size="initial" background_position="top_left" background_repeat="repeat" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_column type="1_2" _builder_version="4.16" custom_padding="|||" global_colors_info="{}" custom_padding__hover="|||"][et_pb_text admin_label="The Krawl Through Krakow" module_class="pink" _builder_version="4.24.2" text_text_color="#db32d8" text_font_size="35" header_font="Montserrat|900|||||||" header_text_color="#fd008a" header_font_size="25px" background_size="initial" background_position="top_left" background_repeat="repeat" text_orientation="center" module_alignment="center" custom_margin_tablet="" custom_margin_phone="30px||7px||false|false" custom_margin_last_edited="on|phone" custom_padding="0px|||" hover_enabled="0" header_3_font_tablet="" header_3_font_phone="" header_3_font_last_edited="on|phone" header_3_font_size_tablet="" header_3_font_size_phone="19px" header_3_font_size_last_edited="on|phone" use_border_color="off" border_style="solid" text_text_align="center" global_colors_info="{}" sticky_enabled="0"]<h3 style="text-align: center;">The Krawl Through Krakow POWER HOUR:<br />1hr of Unlimited Drinks</h3>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_text disabled_on="off||" admin_label="PH" _builder_version="4.24.3" text_font="Montserrat||||||||" background_size="initial" background_position="top_left" background_repeat="repeat" text_orientation="justified" hover_enabled="0" use_border_color="off" border_style="solid" global_colors_info="{}" sticky_enabled="0"]<p>It all begins with a seemingly innocent brightly coloured wristband. We kickstart our night with a truly unbeatable drinks deal: 'THE KRAWL THROUGH KRAKOW'S POWER HOUR'. It's an hour of Unlimited Drinks in one of the best bars in town (and we really really mean Unlimited!), and it's Rocket Fuel for the fun and debauchery to come. During our Pub Crawl's Power Hour take  advantage of the open bar with unlimited drinks... As strong and plentiful as you like, as many as you can handle. Order a couple for yourself and save having to make the trip back to the bar, or get a tray for you and your friends. We're not out to trick you like some lesser Pub Crawl in other cities. We're going to have fun! Check out <a href="https://krawlthroughkrakow.com/how-to-join/">how to join</a> the best Pub Crawl in Krakow.</p>[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type="1_2" _builder_version="4.16" custom_padding="|||" global_colors_info="{}" custom_padding__hover="|||"][et_pb_image src="https://krawlthroughkrakow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/uqieylqxitgbmnasc2ht_compressed_compressed.webp" alt="A large group of people poses together at night in front of a %22PUB KRAWL%22 sign on a cobblestone street. Most are dressed up and appear to be enjoying a social event." title_text="uqieylqxitgbmnasc2ht_compressed_compressed" align_tablet="center" align_phone="" align_last_edited="on|desktop" admin_label="Image" _builder_version="4.27.4" use_border_color="off" border_color="#ffffff" border_width="1px" border_style="solid" animation="off" sticky="off" global_colors_info="{}"][/et_pb_image][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure="1_2,1_2" padding_mobile="off" column_padding_mobile="on" admin_label="Row" _builder_version="4.16" background_size="initial" background_position="top_left" background_repeat="repeat" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_column type="1_2" _builder_version="4.16" custom_padding="|||" global_colors_info="{}" custom_padding__hover="|||"][et_pb_image src="https://krawlthroughkrakow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/perimbpnfuutdrdhv7ho_compressed_compressed.webp" alt="Three women wearing floral dresses and flower crowns hold drinks and smile at a pub crawl event. %22Pub Krawl%22 logo is visible at the bottom of the image." title_text="perimbpnfuutdrdhv7ho_compressed_compressed" align_tablet="center" align_phone="" align_last_edited="on|desktop" admin_label="Image" _builder_version="4.27.4" use_border_color="off" border_color="#ffffff" border_width="1px" border_style="solid" animation="off" sticky="off" global_colors_info="{}"][/et_pb_image][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type="1_2" _builder_version="4.16" custom_padding="|||" global_colors_info="{}" custom_padding__hover="|||"][et_pb_text admin_label="The Krawl Through Krakow" module_class="pink" _builder_version="4.24.2" text_text_color="#db32d8" text_font_size="35" header_font="Montserrat|900|||||||" header_text_color="#fd008a" header_font_size="25px" background_size="initial" background_position="top_left" background_repeat="repeat" text_orientation="center" module_alignment="center" custom_margin_tablet="" custom_margin_phone="6px||23px||false|false" custom_margin_last_edited="on|phone" custom_padding="0px|||" hover_enabled="0" header_3_font_tablet="" header_3_font_phone="" header_3_font_last_edited="on|phone" header_3_font_size_tablet="" header_3_font_size_phone="19px" header_3_font_size_last_edited="on|phone" use_border_color="off" border_style="solid" text_text_align="center" global_colors_info="{}" sticky_enabled="0"]<h3 style="text-align: center;">Krakow Pub Crawl drinking games, prizes and contests:</h3>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_text disabled_on="off||" admin_label="PH 2" _builder_version="4.24.3" text_font="Montserrat||||||||" background_size="initial" background_position="top_left" background_repeat="repeat" text_orientation="justified" custom_margin="-23px||||false|false" hover_enabled="0" use_border_color="off" border_style="solid" global_colors_info="{}" sticky_enabled="0"]<p>Also featured during the Power Hour: drinking games (too many to list but some of our favourites are horse race, flip club, drinking Jenga). Our prize giveaways include our special Krawl Through Krakow pub crawl t-shirts for people who successfully pass challenges set by our Pub Crawl Guides. It's the perfect way to break the ice at the start of the night and get the party going in Krakow! After all of this (and I know it sounds like a lot for the first hour), we hit up three more of Krakow's top bars and clubs. The selection of bars and clubs varies from night to night. It is totally up to our skilled guides to sniff out where the best party will be. They can smell a good time like a hammerhead shark can find a bleeding diver. You will be treated to welcome shots upon entry to each bar and club and there's no waiting in line as we skip the queue at each venue. We do NOT believe in pause buttons. We are the original and the best Pub Crawl in Krakow.<a href="https://krawlthroughkrakow.com/how-to-join/"> Join us</a> tonight!</p>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_text disabled_on="off||" admin_label="PH 2" _builder_version="4.24.3" text_font="Montserrat||||||||" background_size="initial" background_position="top_left" background_repeat="repeat" text_orientation="justified" custom_margin="-23px||||false|false" hover_enabled="0" use_border_color="off" border_style="solid" global_colors_info="{}" sticky_enabled="0"]<p>Also featured during the Power Hour: drinking games (too many to list but some of our favourites are horse race, flip club, drinking Jenga). Our prize giveaways include our special Krawl Through Krakow pub crawl t-shirts for people who successfully pass challenges set by our Pub Crawl Guides. It's the perfect way to break the ice at the start of the night and get the party going in Krakow! After all of this (and I know it sounds like a lot for the first hour), we hit up three more of Krakow's top bars and clubs. The selection of bars and clubs varies from night to night. It is totally up to our skilled guides to sniff out where the best party will be. They can smell a good time like a hammerhead shark can find a bleeding diver. You will be treated to welcome shots upon entry to each bar and club and there's no waiting in line as we skip the queue at each venue. We do NOT believe in pause buttons. We are the original and the best Pub Crawl in Krakow.<a href="https://krawlthroughkrakow.com/how-to-join/"> Join us</a> tonight!</p>[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure="1_2,1_2" padding_mobile="off" column_padding_mobile="on" admin_label="Row" _builder_version="4.16" background_size="initial" background_position="top_left" background_repeat="repeat" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_column type="1_2" _builder_version="4.16" custom_padding="|||" global_colors_info="{}" custom_padding__hover="|||"][et_pb_text admin_label="The Krawl Through Krakow" module_class="pink" _builder_version="4.24.2" text_text_color="#db32d8" text_font_size="35" header_font="Montserrat|900|||||||" header_text_color="#fd008a" header_font_size="25px" background_size="initial" background_position="top_left" background_repeat="repeat" text_orientation="center" module_alignment="center" custom_margin_tablet="" custom_margin_phone="30px||7px||false|false" custom_margin_last_edited="on|phone" custom_padding="0px|||" header_3_font_tablet="" header_3_font_phone="" header_3_font_last_edited="on|phone" header_3_font_size_tablet="" header_3_font_size_phone="19px" header_3_font_size_last_edited="on|phone" use_border_color="off" border_style="solid" text_text_align="center" global_colors_info="{}"]<h3 style="text-align: center;">The best of Krakow Nightlife</h3>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_text disabled_on="off||" admin_label="Types of places" _builder_version="4.24.3" text_font="Montserrat||||||||" background_size="initial" background_position="top_left" background_repeat="repeat" text_orientation="justified" use_border_color="off" border_style="solid" global_colors_info="{}"]<p>The types of venues we tend to find ourselves in vary. They range from cool Polish shot bars and clubs, to funky Disco era underground pubs with a stripper pole on the dance floor to grind away on, or kicking karaoke clubs. We end each night in a pumping club where you can party the night away till the early hours. And all the while our professional photographer will record your night with the kind of clarity your pickled hippocampus won't allow you to. From start to finish the adventures will be set into digital history, and uploaded to our Facebook profile. Freeze frames to testify to a well night well partied in one of the most beautiful european cities.</p>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_text disabled_on="off||" admin_label="Main Tenants" _builder_version="4.24.2" text_font="Montserrat||||||||" background_size="initial" background_position="top_left" background_repeat="repeat" text_orientation="justified" use_border_color="off" border_style="solid" global_colors_info="{}"]<p>Our main tenets are thus: - To make sure that EVERY one of our pubcrawlers is kept safe as they explode into the nightlife culture of Poland and Krakow and all it's awesome little nooks and crannies. - To make sure that Every one of our pubcrawlers has an amazing time and looks back on their night out as the best part of their days spent in the city.</p>
<p>We take Partying Seriously.<br />We are Krawl Through Krakow Pub Crawl.</p>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_cta button_url="https://krawlthroughkrakow.com/store2/pub-crawl-28/#book" url_new_window="on" button_text="Bookings and Enquiries" admin_label="Call To Action" _builder_version="4.27.8" use_background_color="off" background_size="initial" background_position="top_left" background_repeat="repeat" custom_button="on" button_text_size="27px" button_text_color="#ffffff" button_bg_color="#fd008a" button_border_radius="3px" button_font="||||||||" background_layout="light" hover_enabled="0" button_text_color_hover="#ffffff" button_bg_color_hover="#fd008a" use_border_color="off" border_color="#ffffff" border_width="1px" border_style="solid" global_colors_info="{}" button_text_size__hover_enabled="off" button_one_text_size__hover_enabled="off" button_two_text_size__hover_enabled="off" button_text_color__hover_enabled="on" button_text_color__hover="#ffffff" button_one_text_color__hover_enabled="off" button_two_text_color__hover_enabled="off" button_border_width__hover_enabled="off" button_one_border_width__hover_enabled="off" button_two_border_width__hover_enabled="off" button_border_color__hover_enabled="off" button_one_border_color__hover_enabled="off" button_two_border_color__hover_enabled="off" button_border_radius__hover_enabled="off" button_one_border_radius__hover_enabled="off" button_two_border_radius__hover_enabled="off" button_letter_spacing__hover_enabled="off" button_one_letter_spacing__hover_enabled="off" button_two_letter_spacing__hover_enabled="off" button_bg_color__hover_enabled="on" button_bg_color__hover="#fd008a" button_one_bg_color__hover_enabled="off" button_two_bg_color__hover_enabled="off" sticky_enabled="0"][/et_pb_cta][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type="1_2" _builder_version="4.16" custom_padding="|||" global_colors_info="{}" custom_padding__hover="|||"][et_pb_image src="https://krawlthroughkrakow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/gylkrbla4ywgm9nbynfv_compress