SSIONAL DRUNK GUIDES" _builder_version="4.22.1" _module_preset="default" header_font_size="25px" body_font="Montserrat||||||||" body_font_size="18px" text_orientation="center" custom_padding="||50px||false|false" global_colors_info="{}"]<p>We will bring you to the best  parties in town!</p>[/et_pb_blurb][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built="1" next_background_color="#ee357b" admin_label="TripAdvisor" _builder_version="4.22.2" _module_preset="default" background_enable_color="off" custom_padding="0px|0px|85px||false|false" bottom_divider_style="arrow2" bottom_divider_height="45px" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_row _builder_version="4.24.1" _module_preset="default" background_color="#ee357b" width="100%" max_width="2560px" module_alignment="center" custom_margin="0px|0px||auto|false|false" custom_padding="0px|0px|||false|false" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_column type="4_4" _builder_version="4.22.1" _module_preset="default" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_text _builder_version="4.24.2" _module_preset="default" header_text_align="center" header_2_text_color="#FFFFFF" text_orientation="center" width="71.8%" max_width="100%" module_alignment="center" custom_margin="||||false|false" custom_padding="15px|||40px|false|false" hover_enabled="0" global_colors_info="{}" sticky_enabled="0"]<h2 style="text-align: center;">WE’RE THE #1 PUB CRAWL IN KRAKOW SINCE 2008</h2>[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure="3_5,2_5" _builder_version="4.24.2" _module_preset="default" max_width="1048px" custom_padding="50px||15px||false|false" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_column type="3_5" _builder_version="4.24.2" _module_preset="default" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_text admin_label="H_The Original" _builder_version="4.24.2" _module_preset="default" text_orientation="center" width="100%" module_alignment="center" custom_padding="40px||||false|false" global_colors_info="{}"]<h2 style="text-align: left;">The Original &amp; the best Pub Crawl in Krakow since 2008</h2>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_text admin_label="Text: WeAre" _builder_version="4.24.3" _module_preset="default" text_font="Montserrat||||||||" header_2_text_color="#fd008a" header_3_text_color="#fd008a" header_3_line_height="1.5em" width="100%" module_alignment="center" hover_enabled="0" global_colors_info="{}" sticky_enabled="0"]<p style="text-align: justify;"><span>We, the Krawl Through Krakow, have run for more than a decade. In that time we have concocted a recipe for the most outrageous balls-to-the-wall night out you will ever live through. </span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span>Scenes from the Hangover set in the backdrop of Medieval Europe are what you should picture. The </span><a href="https://krawlthroughkrakow.com/krakow-nightclubs/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">best underground bars and clubs</a><span>, toasting with local nutters, and punishing your friends in drinking games. It’s any fun person’s wet dream of a night out! What are you waiting for? </span><a href="https://krawlthroughkrakow.com/how-to-join/">Join Us tonight</a><span> for the best Pub Crawl experience you’ll probably forget.</span></p>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_text admin_label="Text" _builder_version="4.24.2" _module_preset="default" text_font="Montserrat||||||||" width="100%" module_alignment="center" hover_enabled="0" global_colors_info="{}" sticky_enabled="0"]<p>Not convinced yet? Take a look at our more than 900 positive reviews from our krawlers on TripAdvisor.</p>[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type="2_5" _builder_version="4.22.2" _module_preset="default" scroll_fade_enable="on" scroll_fade="0|35|35|100|0|100|100" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_code raw_content_phone="<style>
